    "regime_notes": "Positive IC and ICIR in 2020-22 (0.05297/0.14195), 2023-25 (0.04193/0.12304), and 2026-30 (0.04201/0.11776). Small cross-section warrants conservative interpretation. Strong negative multi-day decay indicates one-day-only use.",
